# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Single-account install (optional)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# For a minimal single-account deployment, set TOOLING_ACCOUNT and all three
# DEV_*_ACCOUNT variables to the same 12-digit account ID, leave Staging/Prod
# unset, and the pipeline will deploy a single Dev wave into that account.
